        <h4 style='color:#5dade2;'>Filters</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Filter (F): A nonempty subset F &sub; L, satisfying:
                <ul>
                    <li>a ∧ b ∈ F ⟺ (a ∈ F and b ∈ F)</li>
